 "name_en": "Preferred Supplier List (4RI)",
 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Preferred Supplier List (4RI)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio33b0bbc071dd471b902484e4b6714790\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio33b0bbc071dd471b902484e4b6714790__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">This process allows a purchaser to create preferred lists of suppliers, which can be used in a standard procurement process supported in <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition</span>.</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">Users with a purchaser role can create a standard supplier list or a user-specified supplier list by adding suppliers in the central hub. This list can be maintained for multiple combinations of material groups and company codes that are present in the central hub.</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">For now, the supplier list created in 4RI is only reused by 4RD – Direct Material Sourcing for supplier list recommendation. Therefore, the functional value of 4RI can only be realized when 4RD is also implemented.</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio33b0bbc071dd471b902484e4b6714790__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Create standard supplier list</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Create user-specified supplier list</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Activate or deactivate supplier list</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Convert user-specified supplier list to standard supplier list</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Reject or accept supplier addition or deletion requests to the standard supplier list</li>\n      </ul>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio33b0bbc071dd471b902484e4b6714790__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Maintain supplier list centrally</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Improve the process of controlling suppliers to be used in procurement process</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Manage preferred supplier list efficiently</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>首选供应商清单 (4RI)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio33b0bbc071dd471b902484e4b6714790\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio33b0bbc071dd471b902484e4b6714790__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">此流程允许采购员创建首选供应商清单，这些供应商清单可用于 <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition</span> 中支持的标准采购流程。</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">具有采购员角色的用户可以通过在集中中心添加供应商来创建标准供应商清单或用户指定的供应商清单。对于中央中心中存在的多个物料组和公司代码的组合，可以维护此清单。</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">目前，在 4RI 中创建的供应商清单仅由 4RD - 直接物料货源确定重用以进行供应商清单建议。因此，只有在同时实施 4RD 时，才能实现 4RI 的功能价值。</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio33b0bbc071dd471b902484e4b6714790__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">创建标准供应商清单</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">创建用户指定的供应商清单</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">激活或取消激活供应商清单</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">将用户指定的供应商清单转换为标准供应商清单</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">拒绝或接受标准供应商清单的供应商添加或删除请求。</li>\n      </ul>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio33b0bbc071dd471b902484e4b6714790__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">集中维护供应商清单</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">改进控制供应商的流程，以便在采购流程中使用</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">高效管理首选供应商清单</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
